e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −5 to +4 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1984","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-chicago-bears","name":"Chicago Bears","code":"CHI","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 156)","str":86.8,"squad":[["Jim McMahon","QB",87],["Steve Fuller","QB",70],["Walter Payton","RB",97],["Matt Suhey","RB",84],["Willie Gault","WR",82],["Dennis McKinnon","WR",79],["Ken Margerum","WR",68],["James Maness","WR",59],["Emery Moorehead","TE",78],["Tim Wrightman","TE",68],["Jay Hilgenberg","OL",98],["Keith Van Horne","OL",98],["Mark Bortz","OL",98],["Jim Covert","OL",84],["Tom Thayer","OL",75],["Kurt Becker","OL",61],["Andy Frederick","OL",58],["Richard Dent","DL",99],["Steve McMichael","DL",87],["Dan Hampton","DL",85],["William Perry","DL",74],["Mike Hartenstine","DL",69],["Henry Waechter","DL",63],["Otis Wilson","LB",99],["Wilber Marshall","LB",92],["Mike Singletary","LB",88],["Leslie Frazier","CB",92],["Mike Richardson","CB",81],["Kenny Taylor","CB",68],["Reggie Phillips","CB",66],["Dave Duerson","S",91],["Gary Fencik","S",85],["Kevin Butler","K",99]]},{"id":"nfl-new-england-patriots","name":"New England Patriots","code":"NEP","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 143)","str":82.1,"squad":[["Steve Grogan","QB",76],["Tony Eason","QB",74],["Craig James","RB",95],["Tony Collins","RB",90],["Mosi Tatupu","RB",70],["Irving Fryar","WR",87],["Stanley Morgan","WR",83],["Cedric Jones","WR",73],["Stephen Starring","WR",69],["Lin Daw